"""
HiDDeN vs MoE benchmark (100+ images).

Metrics per attack:
  - PSNR (median, host vs watermarked+attacked)
  - Bit accuracy (30-bit payload)
  - AUROC, TPR @ 1% FPR

Attack suites:
  waves  — benchmark_attacks.py from WAVES (PIL / cross-method comparison)
  hidden — HiDDeN noise_layers (9 attacks, RQ2 strengths) + 5 WAVES-only PIL attacks
           (rotation, resized_crop, erasing, brightness, contrast)

Example (from repo root):
  .\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe benchmark ^
      --attack-suite hidden ^
      --images data\\coco100k\\val ^
      --n-images 800 ^
      --output results\\benchmark_hidden
"""
